Prepares private services and the backup worker without starting an app or taking an initial backup. Use before disaster recovery

Usage: leptoskit infra prepare [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
